{"id":"7082","t":{"th":"Shugo Chara! คาแรคเตอร์ผู้พิทักษ์ Party!","ro":"Shugo Chara! Party!","en":null,"na":"しゅごキャラ！パーティー！","thShared":true},"cover":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx7082-rAP8yIsUcj89.png","coverM":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx7082-rAP8yIsUcj89.png","color":"#f1e428","banner":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/7082-9gSHUUuDO1IN.jpg","fmt":"TV","status":"FINISHED","eps":25,"dur":25,"season":"FALL","year":2009,"start":"2009-10-03","country":"JP","genres":["Comedy","Mahou Shoujo","Romance"],"score":65,"pop":13279,"studio":"Satelight","desc":"Amu meets a super-peppy transfer student at Seiyo Academy Elementary School named Hiiragi Rikka at school one day. Not only can she see Guardian Characters, but it seems she has some other, mysterious powers as well. When she sees the work that Amu and the other Guardians do at school, she's awestruck.\n\nEach 24-25 minute episode consists of a series of variety show style shorts (including Shugo Chara! Pucchi Puchi) totaling approx. 9-10 minutes, followed by the main 11-12 minute animation titled Shugo Chara!!! Dokki Doki which is the actual continuation of season 2 and comes with it's own opening animation. The remaining time is occupied by live action padding between each section and capped off with the opening/ending themes at the beginning and end of the episode.","descTh":"วันหนึ่ง Amu ได้พบกับนักเรียนที่ย้ายมาใหม่ที่โรงเรียน Seiyo Academy Elementary School ชื่อ Hiiragi Rikka ที่โรงเรียน เธอไม่เพียงแค่มองเห็นตัวละครผู้พิทักษ์เท่านั้น แต่ดูเหมือนว่าเธอมีพลังลึกลับอื่นๆ ด้วยเช่นกัน เมื่อเธอเห็นงานที่อามูและผู้พิทักษ์คนอื่นๆ ทำที่โรงเรียน เธอก็ตกใจมาก\n\nแต่ละตอนมีความยาว 24-25 นาทีประกอบด้วยซีรีส์กางเกงขาสั้นสไตล์วาไรตี้โชว์ (รวมถึง Shugo Chara! Pucchi Puchi) รวมประมาณ 1,000 ตอน ความยาว 9-10 นาที ตามด้วยแอนิเมชั่นหลักความยาว 11-12 นาที เรื่อง Shugo Chara!!! Dokki Doki ซึ่งเป็นภาคต่อที่แท้จริงของซีซั่น 2 และมาพร้อมกับแอนิเมชั่นเปิดของตัวเอง เวลาที่เหลือจะถูกครอบครองโดยการแสดงสดระหว่างแต่ละส่วน และปิดท้ายด้วยธีมเปิด/ปิดที่จุดเริ่มต้นและจุดสิ้นสุดของตอน","src":{"meta":"anilist","th":null,"descTh":"gtranslate"},"trailer":null,"al":"https://anilist.co/anime/7082","mal":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/7082","jp":null,"sched":[],"prov":[{"p":"pops_th","r":"TH","u":"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLZ8H2AInKveksmneKsapSb6bGRETQidK2","lang":"dub","eps":[["7","y:yJLd5nGvFAA",1730257462,"~",null,"109",{"d":935,"sk":[[779.2,925.3]]}],["8","y:w5N4IvJH9fA",1730257462,"~",null,"110",{"d":936,"sk":[[896.0,925.3]]}],["9","y:8WwV5aPwghk",1730257462,"~",null,"111",{"d":936,"sk":[[897.0,926.2]]}],["10","y:sJqMAbTY37I",1730257462,"~",null,"112",{"d":936,"sk":[[896.0,925.3]]}],["11","y:n4nkfJPJ35w",1730257462,"~",null,"113",{"d":937,"sk":[[897.0,926.2]]}],["12","y:UhIoFWNmoe4",1730257462,"~",null,"114",{"d":936,"sk":[[896.0,925.3]]}],["13","y:AM4z96Gc7yM",1730257462,"~",null,"115",{"d":935,"sk":[[896.0,925.3]]}],["14","y:oM9-0EllhMc",1730257462,"~",null,"116",{"d":935,"sk":[[895.1,924.3]]}],["15","y:W9GDu1YfncI",1730257462,"~",null,"117",{"d":935,"sk":[[896.0,925.3]]}],["16","y:NVl3djDy7i0",1730257462,"~",null,"118",{"d":936,"sk":[[897.0,926.2]]}],["17","y:iomamYVf9CE",1730257462,"~",null,"119",{"d":936,"sk":[[604.5,633.8]]}],["18","y:BRZu3df9MFQ",1730257462,"~",null,"120",{"d":936,"sk":[[896.0,925.3]]}],["19","y:Z77MCdrszB4",1730257462,"~",null,"121",{"d":937,"sk":[[897.0,926.2]]}],["20","y:LNYJeiJVtmg",1730257462,"~",null,"122",{"d":935,"sk":[[749.9,779.2]]}],["21","y:VJd7EiKXKr0",1730257462,"~",null,"123",{"d":935,"sk":[[896.0,925.3]]}],["22","y:4mXxS8jrEos",1730257462,"~",null,"124",{"d":935,"sk":[[895.1,924.3]]}],["23","y:NPveWjyx6Uc",1730257462,"~",null,"125",{"d":935,"sk":[[896.0,925.3]]}],["24","y:Gu9PhyXu2To",1730257462,"~",null,"126",{"d":936,"sk":[[897.0,926.2]]}],["25","y:RlFhbhsFBUI",1730257462,"~",null,"127",{"d":1070,"sk":[[980.8,1010.6]],"fin":1}],["6","y:pI-EhYYk_lk",1706166017,"x",